# Uplink bandwidth steps, 20 s each: 3 -> 1 -> 0.5 -> 2 Mbit/s. The last line holds the 2 Mbit/s
# step until the profile repeats.
0 up delay 30ms 3ms rate 3mbit limit 100
20 up delay 30ms 3ms rate 1mbit limit 100
40 up delay 30ms 3ms rate 500kbit limit 100
60 up delay 30ms 3ms rate 2mbit limit 100
80 up delay 30ms 3ms rate 2mbit limit 100
